Subject: [PATCH] Agents run commands on any online device; Cloud chats reach
 every device (#1458)

zeronsh/zeron#1458 at a4e90bbf, its own diff (from main f6a9bbfc) onto
zeron/zgx and the nightly's patches. zgx doesn't have main's PowerShell
terminal picker, so agent commands get it as terminals::command_shell
(PowerShell on Windows, as the PR's Windows tests expect) while terminal
tabs keep zgx's %COMSPEC%. The plugin preview blocks agents.cloud_key
